```js
visitor: {
  Declaration: {
    overflow(property) { /* ... */ },
    custom: { size(property) { /* ... */ } }
  }
}
```

The other examples on the transforms page work as written. We'll fix the three `Property` examples (and a small mistake in the dependencies example, where the glob dependency is returned as `glob`, not `filePath`).

